{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_003_ko_003_0020_0010", "id": null, "offset": 13, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "風下本脫夷字, 從『太平御覽』八十二, 引補.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_003_ko_003_0020_0020", "id": null, "offset": 9, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "『後漢書』 東夷傳注·『路史』 後紀十四引, 皆同.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_003_ko_003_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 11, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "『後漢書』東夷傳注引云：少康卽位, 方夷來賓.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_003_ko_003_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 11, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "『後漢書』東夷傳注引同.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_003_ko_003_0050_0010", "id": null, "offset": 27, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "今本, 白夷以下作玄夷·風夷·□□·黃夷, 從『後漢書』東夷傳注引改. 『路史』後紀十四注引下有繇是服從四字.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_003_ko_003_0060_0010", "id": null, "offset": 35, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "『北堂書鈔』八十二引同. 『後漢書』東夷傳注引無再保墉會于上池七字. 孫本無會字.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_003_ko_003_0080_0010", "id": null, "offset": 10, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "『後漢書』東夷傳注引云, 仲丁卽位, 征于藍夷.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_003_ko_003_0090_0010", "id": null, "offset": 10, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "『太平御覽』八十四引同.", "type": "원주"}
